  - id: chains_of_darkness
    displayName: Chains of Darkness
    flavorText: The angels who kept not their first estate are held by God in everlasting
      chains under darkness unto the judgment of the great day.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: 'Three precedents of certain judgment despite prior favor or status,
      used to warn that ancestry or spiritual privilege does not exempt anyone from
      judgment: the LORD''s own delivered people perished in unbelief after the Exodus,
      the angels who abandoned their proper estate are held in chains awaiting judgment,
      and Sodom and Gomorrha suffer as a public example of eternal fire''s vengeance.'
    deliveredByManagerId: jude
    managerId: law_ot_judgment_precedents
