  - id: the_archangels_rebuke
    displayName: The Archangel's Rebuke
    flavorText: Michael the archangel disputes with the devil over the body of Moses
      yet, even so provoked, dares not bring a railing accusation, saying only, The
      Lord rebuke thee.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Contrasts the false teachers' brazen 'railing accusation' against spiritual
      dignities with the restraint of Michael the archangel, who -- even disputing
      directly with the devil over the body of Moses -- did not presume to bring
      a railing accusation himself but deferred to the Lord.
    deliveredByManagerId: jude
    managerId: law_michael_moses_body
