  - id: way_of_cain_error_of_balaam_gainsaying_of_core
    displayName: The Way of Cain, the Error of Balaam, the Gainsaying of Core
    flavorText: Jude pronounces woe on those who follow the way of Cain, run greedily
      after the error of Balaam for reward, and perish in the gainsaying of Core.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: 'A pronounced ''Woe'' listing three OT figures whose sins model three
      distinct failures repeated in the false teachers: Cain''s murderous hatred
      of a righteous brother, Balaam''s greed that led him to sell his gift for reward,
      and Core''s (Korah''s) rebellion against divinely ordained authority.'
    deliveredByManagerId: jude
    managerId: law_apostasy_examples
