  - id: enochs_prophecy_of_the_ten_thousands
    displayName: Enoch's Prophecy of the Ten Thousands
    flavorText: Enoch, the seventh from Adam, prophesies that the Lord comes with
      ten thousands of his saints to execute judgment upon the ungodly.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Jude directly quotes a prophecy attributed to Enoch, 'the seventh from
      Adam,' foretelling the Lord's coming with 'ten thousands of his saints' to
      execute judgment and convict the ungodly of their deeds and hard speeches.
    deliveredByManagerId: 
