  - id: mockers_in_the_last_time
    displayName: Mockers in the Last Time
    flavorText: Jude reminds his readers that the apostles foretold mockers would
      arise in the last time, walking after their own ungodly lusts.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Jude reminds his readers of a prediction already made by 'the apostles
      of our Lord Jesus Christ' -- that mockers walking after their own ungodly lusts
      would arise in the last time -- and identifies the false teachers currently
      troubling the readers as the fulfillment of that warning.
